      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그럼 난 좀 잘게. 훈련 끝나면 깨워줘.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "じゃあボクはちょっと寝るから、トレーニングが終わったら起こしてねぇ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 4,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "그만, 멈춰. 자연스럽게 넘어가려고 하지 마.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "ダメだ。しれっと誤魔化そうとするんじゃない。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "으음… <color=#F7BE45>자연체</color> 기술이 통하지 않다니…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "う～ん…<color=#F7BE45>自然体</color>の技術が通じないとは…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이럴 줄 알았으면 사저에게 좀 더 열심히 배워둘걸 그랬네.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "師姉からちゃんと習っておけばよかった。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아무튼 배고프고 피곤해… 조금만 쉬었다 하자.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "とにかくボクは疲れたし、お腹がすいたんだ。ちょっと休んでからにしよう。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "지난번엔 열심히 하겠다고 했었던 것 같은데…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "この前は、次から頑張るって言ってたような気がするけど…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그랬나? 뭐, 그랬던 것 같기도 하고.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そうだっだっけ？まあ、言われてみればそうだったような気もするけど。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 단장. 세상에 변하지 않는 건 없어.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "でも、団長。世の中に変わらないものはないんだよ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "내가 있던 풍월당에 이런 말이 있어. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ボクがいた風月堂には、こんな言葉があるんだ。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "<color=#F7BE45>바람과 달도 변하는데 우리라고 다르겠는가?</color>",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "<color=#F7BE45>風や月もうつろうのに、果たして我らは昨日と同じ人間だと言えるだろうか？</color>",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgCrash": 0.3,
      "BgCrashTime": 0.3,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "즉!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "つまり！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "예전의 나와 지금의 나는 완전 달라, 단장. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "前のボクと、今のボクは違うってことだよ。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_OWL",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "난 변했어.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ボクは変わったんだ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkAppend": true
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_OWL_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
